# The API's image builds from the project root (the workspace holds
# `Cargo.lock`), so these paths are relative to the root. BuildKit reads
# this file for `docker build -f apps/api/Dockerfile .`. The workspace's
# Rust members stay in: cargo reads every member's manifest.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.terraform
**/.dart_tool
.git
apps/api/storage
apps/web
apps/mobile
